{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_005_fcn-title\">FCN</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">FC→Conv 的整图 dense prediction，加 pool3/pool4 分数级 skip fusion。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Converts image-level FC layers into 1×1 convolutions for arbitrary-size dense prediction with pool3/pool4 skip score fusion.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">任意尺寸 2D 图像</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Arbitrary-size 2D image</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">与输入对齐的像素级类别 logits</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Pixel-aligned semantic class probability map</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 3 · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content_cvpr_2015/html/Long_Fully_Convolutional_Networks_2015_CVPR_paper.html\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_005_fcn')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_005_fcn')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"FCN original paper architecture figure, Figure 3\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/944c6cfd4384d2092854.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 3 · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 10 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_005_fcn\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_005_fcn')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_005_fcn\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 10 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积 Backbone</span><span class=\"lang-en\">convolution Backbone</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">VGG 式卷积与池化逐级生成 pool3、pool4 和深层语义特征。</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests arbitrary-size 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (convolution Backbone).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"VGG 式卷积与池化逐级生成 pool3、pool4 和深层语义特征。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests arbitrary-size 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (convolution Backbone).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"卷积 Backbone\" data-node-name-en=\"convolution Backbone\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">卷积 Backbone</span><span class=\"lang-en\">convolution Backbone</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">VGG 式卷积与池化逐级生成 pool3、pool4 和深层语义特征。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests arbitrary-size 2d image and prepares initial tensor representations (convolution Backbone).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把分类器全连接层改写为卷积，使网络可处理任意尺寸输入。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes FC→Conv to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"FC→Conv\" data-node-name-en=\"FC→Conv\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>FC→Conv</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把分类器全连接层改写为卷积，使网络可处理任意尺寸输入。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes FC→Conv to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在最深低分辨率特征上预测粗语义分数图。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Score32 within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"Score32\" data-node-name-en=\"Score32\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Score32</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在最深低分辨率特征上预测粗语义分数图。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Score32 within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"learned deconvolution 将粗分数恢复到 pool4 尺度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2× upsampling within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"2× 上采样\" data-node-name-en=\"2× upsampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">2× 上采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2× upsampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">learned deconvolution 将粗分数恢复到 pool4 尺度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2× upsampling within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"用 1×1 Conv 把中层 pool4 特征映射为类别分数。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Pool4 Score within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Pool4 Score\" data-node-name-en=\"Pool4 Score\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Pool4 Score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">用 1×1 Conv 把中层 pool4 特征映射为类别分数。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Pool4 Score within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"深层语义分数与 pool4 分数逐元素相加。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs FCN-16s fusion within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"FCN-16s 融合\" data-node-name-en=\"FCN-16s fusion\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">FCN-16s 融合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">FCN-16s fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">深层语义分数与 pool4 分数逐元素相加。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs FCN-16s fusion within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"把融合结果提升到 pool3 尺度。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2× upsampling within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"再 2× 上采样\" data-node-name-en=\"2× upsampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">再 2× 上采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2× upsampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">把融合结果提升到 pool3 尺度。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2× upsampling within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"较浅层特征提供更细空间定位。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Pool3 Score within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"Pool3 Score\" data-node-name-en=\"Pool3 Score\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Pool3 Score</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">较浅层特征提供更细空间定位。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Pool3 Score within the core dense prediction with skips computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"加入 pool3 分数，形成更精细的类别响应。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies FCN-8s fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"8\" data-node-name=\"FCN-8s 融合\" data-node-name-en=\"FCN-8s fusion\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 8)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">09</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">FCN-8s 融合</span><span class=\"lang-en\">FCN-8s fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">加入 pool3 分数，形成更精细的类别响应。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies FCN-8s fusion to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将融合分数恢复到原图并输出逐像素预测。\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces pixel-aligned semantic class probability map via 8× upsampling.\" data-node-idx=\"9\" data-node-name=\"8× 上采样\" data-node-name-en=\"8× upsampling\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_005_fcn', 9)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">10</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">8× 上采样</span><span class=\"lang-en\">8× upsampling</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将融合分数恢复到原图并输出逐像素预测。</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces pixel-aligned semantic class probability map via 8× upsampling.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"FCN Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · FCN-8s 的三级分数图跳接融合</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · FCN-8s Multi-Stride Score Map Skip Fusion</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"FCN：核心公式 · FCN-8s 的三级分数图跳接融合\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg a